        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spirit of the Law of the West roams... as a Pile o' Pasta?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's more likely than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Joe's boys are running wild in the west, and only a pile of spaghetti, possessed by the hat of a dead lawman can stop them. Dish out justice by combining pasta ingredients to create over 1800 unique recipes to fight back against Big Joe's gun-toting goons in turn-based pasta-at-dawn duels. Only the best recipes will bring justice to the west before your foes bring you to starchy oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161290/extras/54b6e8d342d9d7596e1521460e5dc6a5.avif?t=1764906993\" width=250 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with the denizens of the wild west before the pistols and pasta starts flying. Follow the story of Big Joe's consequences on the west, and dismantle his crime empire. From the friendly Ol' Toot to the nefarious Angel Hair, the west is packed with interesting characters to meet and foes to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161290/extras/bced1822b86b477c51c19a2977bcf3cd.avif?t=1764906993\" width=250 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble ingredients to build devastating attacks in turn-based wild west duels. Play into affinities and combine like ingredients for massive damage and diabolical status effects. Different pastas deal out damage, while seasoning ramps up the chance of a critical hit! Add in cheese to block and sauces that change the tide to cook up something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161290/extras/7d6fa499948675db2a23574a88a52fdd.avif?t=1764906993\" width=500 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once everything's put together, all that's left to do is<strong> DRAW!!</strong> Sling hot pasta and lead at the right time to conquer your foes and climb further up the ladder to take down Big Joe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spirit of the Law of the West roams... as a Pile o' Pasta?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's more likely than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big Joe's boys are running wild in the west, and only a pile of spaghetti, possessed by the hat of a dead lawman can stop them. Dish out justice by combining pasta ingredients to create over 1800 unique recipes to fight back against Big Joe's gun-toting goons in turn-based pasta-at-dawn duels. Only the best recipes will bring justice to the west before your foes bring you to starchy oblivion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161290/extras/54b6e8d342d9d7596e1521460e5dc6a5.avif?t=1764906993\" width=250 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with the denizens of the wild west before the pistols and pasta starts flying. Follow the story of Big Joe's consequences on the west, and dismantle his crime empire. From the friendly Ol' Toot to the nefarious Angel Hair, the west is packed with interesting characters to meet and foes to take down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161290/extras/bced1822b86b477c51c19a2977bcf3cd.avif?t=1764906993\" width=250 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble ingredients to build devastating attacks in turn-based wild west duels. Play into affinities and combine like ingredients for massive damage and diabolical status effects. Different pastas deal out damage, while seasoning ramps up the chance of a critical hit! Add in cheese to block and sauces that change the tide to cook up something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: 